The graph shows requests for four lunchtime activities.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=12mm,y=8mm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\draw[draw=black,->] (0,0)--(0,5.6);
\draw[draw=black,->] (0,0)--(5,0);
\foreach \y/\v in {0/0,1/5,2/10,3/15,4/20,5/25} {
\draw[draw=black] (-0.1,\y)--(0,\y);
\path (-0.15,\y) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\v$};
}
\draw[draw=black] (0.5,0) rectangle (1.1,3);
\draw[draw=black] (1.6,0) rectangle (2.2,5);
\draw[draw=black] (2.7,0)--(3.3,0);
\draw[draw=black] (3.8,0) rectangle (4.4,2);
\foreach \x/\lab in {0.8/Art,1.9/Sport,3/Music,4.1/Chess} {
\path (\x,-0.15) node[below] {\lab};
}
\path (-0.9,2.7) node[rotate=90] {Requests};
\path (2.5,-0.9) node[below] {Activity};
\path (2.5,6.1) node {Lunchtime activity requests};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

(a) How many requests were there for Art?
(b) Which activity had the most requests? Which had the fewest?
(c) Which had more requests, Art or Chess?
(d) How many more requests were there for Sport than for Chess?

The graph shows the temperature in a classroom. What was the temperature at $11$ a.m.?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=13mm,y=8mm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\draw[draw=black!20,xstep=13mm,ystep=8mm] (0,0) grid (4,6);
\draw[draw=black,->] (0,0)--(0,6.5);
\draw[draw=black,->] (0,0)--(4.5,0);
\foreach \y/\v in {0/0,1/5,2/10,3/15,4/20,5/25,6/30} {
\draw[draw=black] (-0.1,\y)--(0,\y);
\path (-0.15,\y) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\v$};
}
\foreach \x/\lab in {0/{9 a.m.},1/{10 a.m.},2/{11 a.m.},3/{12 noon},4/{1 p.m.}} {
\draw[draw=black] (\x,0)--(\x,-0.1);
\path (\x,-0.15) node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {\lab};
}
\definecolor{seriesblue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\draw[draw=seriesblue,thick] (0,2)--(1,3)--(2,4)--(3,5)--(4,3);
\foreach \x/\y in {0/2,1/3,2/4,3/5,4/3} {
\fill[seriesblue] (\x,\y) circle (1.8pt);
}
\path (-0.9,3) node[rotate=90] {Temperature ($^\circ$C)};
\path (2,-0.85) node[below] {Time};
\path (2,6.9) node {Classroom temperature};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

foundation.question_text:
How many books were borrowed from the Mobile service?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.7]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,6.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(7.5,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/10,2/20,3/30,4/40,5/50} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$};
\draw (0.4,0) rectangle (1.6,3); \draw (2.4,0) rectangle (3.6,5); \draw (4.4,0) rectangle (5.6,4); \foreach \x/\lab in {1/Central,3/Mobile,5/East} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {\lab};}
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.3,2.5) {Books}; \node[below] at (3,-1.0) {Service}; \node at (3,6.1) {Library loans};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Which centre had the most volunteer shifts?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.68]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,6.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(9,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/5,2/10,3/15,4/20,5/25} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$};
\draw (0.4,0) rectangle (1.6,4); \draw (2.4,0) rectangle (3.6,3); \draw (4.4,0) rectangle (5.6,5); \draw (6.4,0) rectangle (7.6,2); \foreach \x/\lab in {1/North,3/South,5/West,7/East} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {\lab};}
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.3,2.5) {Shifts}; \node[below] at (4,-1.0) {Centre}; \node at (4,6.1) {Volunteer shifts};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The line graph shows calls received each hour.
How many calls were received at $11$ a.m.?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.8]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,7.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(8.5,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/5,2/10,3/15,4/20,5/25,6/30} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$};
\foreach \x/\lab in {1/9am,2.4/10am,3.8/11am,5.2/12pm,6.6/1pm} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {\lab};} \draw[thick] (1,2)--(2.4,5)--(3.8,3)--(5.2,6)--(6.6,4); \foreach \p in {(1,2),(2.4,5),(3.8,3),(5.2,6),(6.6,4)} {\fill \p circle (2.5pt);}
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.3,3) {Calls}; \node[below] at (3.8,-1.0) {Time}; \node at (3.8,7.1) {Help-line calls};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

development.question_text:
Which program has more members, Garden or Sports?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.62]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,7.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(11,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/10,2/20,3/30,4/40,5/50,6/60} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$};
\draw (0.4,0) rectangle (1.6,2); \draw (2.4,0) rectangle (3.6,6); \draw (4.4,0) rectangle (5.6,4); \draw (6.4,0) rectangle (7.6,5); \draw (8.4,0) rectangle (9.6,3); \foreach \x/\lab in {1/Arts,3/Fitness,5/Garden,7/Sports,9/Tech} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {\lab};}
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.3,3) {Members}; \node[below] at (5,-1.0) {Program}; \node at (5,7.1) {Centre members};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

How many more visits did Clinic C have than Clinic D?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.68]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,7.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(9,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/20,2/40,3/60,4/80,5/100,6/120} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$};
\draw (0.4,0) rectangle (1.6,2); \draw (2.4,0) rectangle (3.6,5); \draw (4.4,0) rectangle (5.6,6); \draw (6.4,0) rectangle (7.6,3); \foreach \x/\lab in {1/A,3/B,5/C,7/D} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {\lab};}
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.5,3) {Visits}; \node[below] at (4,-1.0) {Clinic}; \node at (4,7.1) {Clinic visits};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Which service received the fewest requests?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.62]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,6.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(11,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/25,2/50,3/75,4/100,5/125} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$}; \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};}
\draw (0.4,0) rectangle (1.6,3); \draw (2.4,0) rectangle (3.6,5); \draw (4.4,0)--(5.6,0); \draw (6.4,0) rectangle (7.6,2); \draw (8.4,0) rectangle (9.6,4); \foreach \x/\lab in {1/Repair,3/Advice,5/Legal,7/Housing,9/Health} {\node[anchor=north east,rotate=60,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (\x,-0.15) {\lab};}
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.5,2.5) {Requests}; \node[below] at (5,-3.0) {Service}; \node at (5,6.1) {Service requests};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
